# Navia Mavuika Xilonen Xianyun. ~20s Rot. Navia Plunge. After the first rotation, Mavuika uses 2CDFD to fill time.  Xianyun TTDS covers all plunges for Navia. C0 Xilonen doesn't provide RES shred but is worth using for Scroll and energy; 2 Xilonen skill are funneled to Navia.

